1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,882
The milk is not at the back

2
00:00:01,882 --> 00:00:02,816
because of you.

3
00:00:03,116 --> 00:00:05,252
It is there because of a truck.

4
00:00:06,002 --> 00:00:09,722
Truck. Dock. Cold room. Dairy case.

5
00:00:10,022 --> 00:00:12,590
Seven degrees or less, the whole way.

6
00:00:15,002 --> 00:00:17,618
A Wegmans manager said it plainly:

7
00:00:17,918 --> 00:00:19,840
“We don’t have to worry about ever

8
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,254
breaking the cold chain.”

9
00:00:21,654 --> 00:00:23,631
So where does the milk end up?

10
00:00:23,631 --> 00:00:25,278
Where the truck backs in.
